+- `bash docs/harness/bin/sensors.sh quick` — PASS (`PASS (quick lane green)`).
+- `bash docs/harness/bin/check-commit-msg.sh --message "docs(harness): add SKILLS.md policy and loop-engineering skill"`
+  — PASS.
+- Independent cross-model review (Codex) of the `926ff43..HEAD` range. The
+  iterative review artifacts live under
+  `docs/harness/reviews/2026-06-21-b2-loop-skills-policy*-post.md`; the final
